{"type":"message","id":"ed9c8849","parentId":"b6d5671d","timestamp":"2026-04-11T05:32:21.109Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"嘿，刚启动。看起来这是个全新的工作区——没有记忆文件，没有之前的对话历史。\n\n根据 SOUL.md，我应该真诚、有帮助，有自己的个性。USER.md 是空的，所以我需要了解我的用户。\n\n根据系统提示，有一个关于 openclaw.json 配置无效的警告——提到了 \"dreaming\" 和 volcengine 配置的问题。我应该注意这一点，但首先让我打个招呼并了解用户想要什么。\n\n现在我是 kimi-k2.5（volcengine-plan/kimi-k2.5），而默认模型也是这个，所以不需要提及差异。\n\n让我以我的个性回应——简洁、真诚，不 filler。","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"Hey. Just came online. Looks like a fresh start — no memory files, no history, just the open road.\n\nI'm running on kimi-k2.5 (same as the default). \n\nSo — who are you? And what are we doing today?"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"volcengine-plan","model":"kimi-k2.5","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1775885531557,"responseId":"021775885531946c43b249df4b5023f4c24a0f20d5a332190cc57"}}
