{"type":"message","id":"98e63d75","parentId":"7d08db47","timestamp":"2026-04-11T05:32:33.620Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"用户说\"帮我配置梦境\"，这看起来是在请求配置与\"梦境\"相关的功能。从系统消息中我看到有错误信息提到：\n\n```\nConfig invalid File: ~/.openclaw/openclaw.json Problem: - agents.defaults: Unrecognized key: \"dreaming\"\n```\n\n这表明用户可能之前尝试在配置中添加了一个\"dreaming\"键，但这不是有效的配置项。\n\n让我检查一下openclaw.json的配置，看看用户想要配置什么。我需要先了解\"dreaming\"是什么功能 - 可能是与梦境记录、梦境日记相关的功能？\n\n让我先读取openclaw.json看看当前配置。","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"read:5","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/home/node/.openclaw/openclaw.json"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"volcengine-plan","model":"kimi-k2.5","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775885546013,"responseId":"021775885546561c43b249df4b5023f4c24a0f20d5a3321e116d2"}}
