{"type":"message","id":"1ee9f339","parentId":"4693d99b","timestamp":"2026-04-11T10:29:10.114Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b529669eb9ca4ee88f2ee05f48f4\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_cb5c7afa7e77cafdeaeae1620a2a383a\",\n  \"sender\": \"ou_cb5c7afa7e77cafdeaeae1620a2a383a\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Sat 2026-04-11 10:29 UTC\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"ou_cb5c7afa7e77cafdeaeae1620a2a383a\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_cb5c7afa7e77cafdeaeae1620a2a383a\",\n  \"name\": \"ou_cb5c7afa7e77cafdeaeae1620a2a383a\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b529669eb9ca4ee88f2ee05f48f4]\nou_cb5c7afa7e77cafdeaeae1620a2a383a: ⚠️ Cron job \"节点异常检测\" failed: cron: job execution timed out\n这个是什么情况"}],"timestamp":1775903350112}}
{"type":"message","id":"5fc781e9","parentId":"1ee9f339","timestamp":"2026-04-11T10:29:34.112Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"这是一个 cron 任务超时的错误。用户询问 \"⚠️ Cron job \"节点异常检测\" failed: cron: job execution timed out\" 是什么情况。\n\n我需要解释一下 cron job 超时的情况，以及可能的原因和解决方案。","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"这是你的定时任务（cron job）执行超时了。\n\n**\"节点异常检测\"** 这个定时任务在运行过程中超过了设定的最大执行时间，被系统自动终止了。\n\n---\n\n**可能的原因：**\n\n1. **任务卡住了** — 网络请求没响应、死锁、或者等待某个资源\n2. **任务太重了** — 需要处理的数据太多，正常执行时间超过了阈值\n3. **外部依赖挂了** — 依赖的服务/接口响应很慢或超时\n\n---\n\n**你可以检查：**\n\n```bash\n# 查看最近的 cron 日志\nopenclaw logs --cron\n\n# 或者直接看系统日志\nopenclaw logs --tail 100\n```\n\n如果你知道这个 \"节点异常检测\" 任务具体做什么（比如检测什么节点、调用什么接口），我可以帮你判断是配置问题还是需要优化任务逻辑。\n\n这个任务是你自己配置的吗？还是某个插件添加的？"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"volcengine-plan","model":"kimi-k2.5","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1775903350114,"responseId":"0217759033517360e7265ab5c925a85b201dc616c3398bf9f2a4a"}}
