{"type":"message","id":"0b14dcf2","parentId":"8f35be01","timestamp":"2026-04-11T11:08:45.675Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"用户想要合并两个定时任务：\n1. 节点异常检测 (每2小时)\n2. 节点监控 (每天10点和22点)\n\n用户希望：\n- 合并成一个任务\n- 使用 heartbeat 而不是 cron\n- 每2小时检测一次\n- 有异常才汇报，否则静默\n- 每隔10小时或每天汇报一次状态\n\n我需要帮用户配置 heartbeat 来完成这个任务。首先我需要看一下当前的 HEARTBEAT.md 文件，然后根据用户需求更新它。","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"明白，合并成一个 heartbeat 任务更合理。我先看一下当前的 heartbeat 配置。"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"read:6","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/home/node/.openclaw/workspace-lucus/HEARTBEAT.md"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"volcengine-plan","model":"kimi-k2.5","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775905701805,"responseId":"0217759057037360e7265ab5c925a85b201dc616c3398bf922e3b"}}
